    ],
    "text": "MEDIATION BOARDS COMMISSION",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      168.09,
      472.57,
      434.27,
      483.64
    ],
    "text": "Notice Calling for Nominations for the Appointment of Mediators",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      496.57,
      547.29,
      543.64
    ],
    "text": "THE Mediation Boards Commission, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 5 (1) of The Mediation Boards Act, No.72of 1988, invites nominations for the appointment of Chairman and Mediators in respect of resolving land disputes relating togrievances of migrant workers and members of their families residing in Sri Lanka for the following Panel of SpecialMediation Board (Migrant Workers) in terms of Sections 3 of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      239.61,
      568.57,
      362.58,
      579.64
    ],
    "text": "Special Mediation Board Area",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      231.09,
      592.57,
      371.28,
      603.64
    ],
    "text": "Kurunegala Administrative District",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.89,
      617.29,
      547.23,
      667.96
    ],
    "text": "02.The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice calling nominations upon (A) the Individuals, (B) the Bodies,Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (C) the District Secretary / Divisional Secretaries specifiedhereinafter under 02 (II) to submit names of person who are eligible under 02 (I) for appointment as Mediators to thePanel of Mediators for the said Special Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      82.17,
      683.29,
      547.25,
      720.76
    ],
    "text": "(I) The following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board Area whosenames may be so submitted for appointment. A person eligible to be appointed as a Member of the Panel ofMediators in respect of the Special Mediation Board shall;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.91,
      84.49,
      521.11,
      107.73
    ],
    "text": "2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'12'06PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.12.2019",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      90.67,
      115.09,
      242.12,
      126.16
    ],
    "text": "(a) be between 35 to 70 years of age;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      90.67,
      132.01,
      308.88,
      143.08
    ],
    "text": "(b) be a resident of the Special Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.39,
      149.05,
      539.88,
      172.12
    ],
    "text": "(c) have a professional or academic qualification obtained from a recognized professional or higher educationbody established by or under any written law; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      90.67,
      178.09,
      539.9,
      201.16
    ],
    "text": "(d) have been or be a public officer, or a person who holds knowledge and skills in an area relevant to settlementsof disputes and grievances of migrant workers.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.83,
      214.09,
      539.89,
      237.16
    ],
    "text": "(I) (A)The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to thePanel of a particular Special Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      117.67,
      250.09,
      539.9,
      285.16
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the RegionalHead of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particularSpecial Mediation Board area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.39,
      291.01,
      539.92,
      314.08
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Special Mediation Boardarea;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      113.11,
      320.05,
      539.91,
      343.12
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Special Mediation Boardarea;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.83,
      356.05,
      539.88,
      379.12
    ],
    "text": "(B)Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five years andwhich is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      117.67,
      392.05,
      509.86,
      403.12
    ],
    "text": "(i)The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.39,
      409.09,
      383.87,
      420.16
    ],
    "text": "(ii)The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      113.11,
      426.01,
      352.3,
      437.08
    ],
    "text": "(iii)The enhancement of rural or community development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      112.39,
      443.05,
      286.29,
      454.12
    ],
    "text": "(iv)The enhancement of culture of sports",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      114.67,
      460.09,
      539.86,
      483.16
    ],
    "text": "(v)The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplying basicneeds of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.83,
      496.09,
      539.85,
      519.16
    ],
    "text": "(C)The following District Secretary/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment tothe Panel of a particular Special Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      51.67,
      532.69,
      539.9,
      569.56
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph (02) above may submit nominationsof such Public Officers as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above. An individual may not nominate his or hername for nominations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      66.67,
      584.29,
      539.91,
      608.2
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary/Divisional Secretaries referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of PublicOfficers, of whom not more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      51.67,
      621.49,
      158.83,
      632.56
    ],
    "text": "04.Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.39,
      645.49,
      389.86,
      656.56
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cA\u201d below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.67,
      662.41,
      519.56,
      673.48
    ],
    "text": "(b) Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cB\u201d below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      73.39,
      679.45,
      504.71,
      690.52
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretary, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in FORM \u201cC\u201d below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.83,
      703.45,
      539.91,
      726.52
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate FORM and should without fail contain the recommendation of the nominator asindicated in the next paragraph.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.89,
      85.09,
      546.57,
      107.73
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'12'06PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.12.20193A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.89,
      116.89,
      547.29,
      201.4
    ],
    "text": "05.The recommendation of the nominator should not be a recommendation without reasons being assigned. It required toset out specific facts and circumstances to enable the Commission to draw its own reference to the suitability orotherwise of the person nominated for appointment to the Panel of Mediators, such as, for instance, his or her presentor past occupation, the period of service or engagement in such occupations, any position or trust or responsibilityheld by him or her and the office, if any, held by him or her in any social service/ religious/charitable Organization,Society or Body.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.89,
      219.73,
      547.23,
      260.2
    ],
    "text": "06.An individual or a Body, Organizations or Institution should as far as possible, refrain from making more than threenominations in respect of the same Special Mediation Board Area. However, this limitation will not apply to the DistrictSecretary and Divisional Secretaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.89,
      278.53,
      547.03,
      304.62
    ],
    "text": "07.All nominations should be forwarded to reach the Secretary, Mediation Board Commissions, No. 80, Ministry ofJustice\u2019s New Building, Courts Road, Colombo 12. on or before 24th December, 2019",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.89,
      322.69,
      547.25,
      348.4
    ],
    "text": "08.The Mediation Boards Commission will, based on the basic qualifications to be checked at interview, select eligiblecandidates to be offered a preliminary training on Mediation skills and methods.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      57.45,
      376.69,
      547.18,
      402.52
    ],
    "text": "09.Final decision in connection with any matter which is not being prevailed by the regulation stipulated in this notice isthe decision made by Mediation Boards Commission at any time.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      375.69,
      432.37,
      502.41,
      470.44
    ],
    "text": "RAJANI ATHAPATTU,Secretary,Mediation Boards Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      499.81,
      234.48,
      551.44
    ],
    "text": "Office of the Mediation Boards Commission,No. 80, Courts Road,Ministry of Justice\u2019s New Building,Colombo 12.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      555.49,
      139.19,
      566.56
    ],
    "text": "06th December, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      48.91,
      84.49,
      521.11,
      107.73
    ],
    "text": "4AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'12'06PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.12.2019",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      271.27,
      118.33,
      318.55,
      129.4
    ],
    "text": "FORM \u201cA\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      160.99,
      136.45,
      428.83,
      147.52
    ],
    "text": "(To be filled up by individuals eligible to recommend Nominations)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      54.91,
      158.65,
      535.51,
      169.72
    ],
    "text": "01. Mediation Board Area :\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      54.07,
      175.09,
      536.25,
      186.16
    ],
    "text": "02. Administrative District : \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      55.63,
      191.65,
      306.96,
      202.72
    ],
    "text": "03. Particulars of the Individual who recommend Nomination :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
